<p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">You can pick, adjust, and convert colors in real-time. Here’s how the main features work:</span></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class="">Color Selection &amp; Adjustment:</span></strong><span class=""> Use the color picker, enter a HEX code, or drag the hue slider. The large swatch and all value displays update instantly.</span></p>
</li>
<li>
<p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class="">Color Harmonies:</span></strong><span class=""> The tool automatically generates a set of harmonious colors (complementary, split, triadic, and analogous) based on your selected color, displayed as a row of swatches.</span></p>
</li>
<li>
