<p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">You can turn your text into eye-catching styles in just a few steps. Here's how the tool operates:</span></p>
<ol start="1">
<li>
<p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class="">Input &amp; Style Selection</span></strong><span class="">: Type or paste your text into the main input field. Then, click on any style card from the grid (like "Bold," "Script," or "Gothic") to see your text transformed instantly.</span></p>
</li>
<li>
<p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class="">Real-time Preview</span></strong><span class="">: The output area updates immediately as you type or change styles, showing you the fancy version of your text.</span></p>
</li>
<li>
<p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class="">Copy &amp; Use</span></strong><span class="">: Once you're happy with the result, click the "Copy" button to save the styled text to your clipboard. You can then paste it into social media posts, documents, or anywhere else.</span></p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr />
<p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class="">Optimization Tip:</span></strong><span class=""> You can easily customize the tool's style options. To add or remove styles, edit the </span><code>styleMap</code><span class=""> object and the </span><code>styleNames</code><span class=""> array within the </span><code>&lt;script&gt;</code><span class=""> tag.</span></p>","text_color":"#000000"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":false,"styles":{"e-c2ee2ad":{"id":"e-c2ee2ad","label":"local","type":"class","variants":[{"meta":{"breakpoint":"desktop","state":null},"props":{"width":{"$$type":"size","value":{"size":700,"unit":"px"}},"height":{"$$type":"size","value":{"size":400,"unit":"px"}},"margin":{"$$type":"dimensions","value":{"block-start":{"$$type":"size","value":{"size":40,"unit":"px"}}}},"flex-direction":{"$$type":"string","value":"column"}},"custom_css":null}]}},"interactions":[],"editor_settings":[],"version":"0.0"}]

