  <div class="footer-note">
    <span><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> 100% client-side · no data stored</span>
    <span><i class="fas fa-clock"></i> instant · zero latency</span>
    <span><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #0b8a4b;"></i> always functional</span>
